  parent="Muscle"
  oneliner="Peptides are the most precise signaling tools available for re-tuning cognitive performance, body composition, and recovery — but they require lab data and medical oversight to do right."
  slug="peptides"
  description="Practitioner-grade peptide protocols for cognitive performance, body composition, recovery, and longevity. Semax, Selank, Cerebrolysin, BPC-157, Sermorelin, CJC-1295, Ipamorelin, Tesamorelin, MK-677. Delivered through our contracted licensed telemedicine practice."
>
  <!-- ── Why this matters ── -->
  <h2>Why This Matters</h2>
  <ul class="insult-list">
    <li>By age 50, GH output is 50–70% of peak — and most of what restores it is unavailable through standard insurance-covered care</li>
    <li>Peptides amplify the fundamentals: sleep, training, and nutrition compound dramatically when cellular signaling is optimized</li>
