    Peptides are prescribed and dispensed through our contracted licensed telemedicine practice and pharmacy partners only — no direct sale, no research-chemical sourcing.
  </p>

  <!-- ── Condensed Insulting Behaviors ── -->
  <h2>The Insulting Behaviors</h2>
  <ul class="insult-list">
    <li>Buying gray-market peptides without medical oversight — purity and dosing are uncontrolled variables</li>
    <li>Stacking peptides without baseline labs — especially IGF-1, which is the critical GH safety check</li>
    <li>Using peptides as a magic bullet while neglecting sleep, nutrition, and resistance training — they amplify fundamentals, not replace them</li>
    <li>Avoiding the conversation entirely because conventional practitioners won't engage with off-label protocols</li>
